## Slide 4: Core Features & Capabilities
**What Our Chatbot Does**
✅ **Intelligent Q&A**: Context-aware responses using RAG methodology
✅ **Semantic Search**: Finds relevant information from scraped data
✅ **Source Attribution**: Provides source URLs for all responses
✅ **Real-time Processing**: Instant responses with typing indicators
✅ **Responsive Design**: Mobile-friendly interface with modern aesthetics
✅ **Error Handling**: Comprehensive error management and user feedback

---

## Slide 5: Technology Stack
**Modern AI/ML Stack**
- **Backend Framework**: Flask 3.0.3 (Python)
- **AI Engine**: Google Gemini 1.5 Flash
- **Machine Learning**: Sentence Transformers (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
- **Data Processing**: BeautifulSoup, NLTK, scikit-learn
- **Frontend**: HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+)
- **Deployment**: Standalone Python application

---

## Slide 6: Data Pipeline & Processing
**How Data Flows**
```
1. Web Scraping → 2. Content Extraction → 3. Embedding Generation → 4. Storage
     ↓                    ↓                      ↓                    ↓
Target Websites    Structured Data         Vector Embeddings    Local Storage
(Contacts, Jobs)   (Text + Metadata)      (384-dim vectors)    (scraped_data.txt)
```

**Key Capabilities:**
- Automated data collection from target websites
- Intelligent content parsing and categorization
- Vector embeddings for semantic similarity
- Efficient storage with URL mapping

---

## Slide 7: AI & Machine Learning Components
**Intelligent Features**
- **Sentence Embeddings**: 384-dimensional vectors for semantic understanding
- **Similarity Scoring**: Cosine similarity for content relevance ranking
- **Context Retrieval**: Top-K retrieval with configurable thresholds
- **Prompt Engineering**: Optimized prompts for accurate AI responses
- **Fallback Handling**: Graceful degradation when AI services unavailable

